"所有的文档都要是中文的\" -> make user-facing documents and script\r\ns Chinese by default. [Task 1]\r\n- when configuring providers, the user said: \"deepsek的配置不要放在环境变量，要放在一个配置文件中\" and asked for `Claud\r\ne.cmd` to work \"在任何地方\" -> keep provider configuration in Claude Code's global `settings.json`, not persistent Wind\r\nows environment variables or per-repo launchers. [Task 1]\r\n- when CLI worked but GUI failed, the user asked: \"帮我修复好，让我能再命令行和cc gui 中都用\" -> diagnose the two runti\r\nmes separately and prove both against one shared configuration. [Task 1]\r\n- when a provider stopped working, the user accepted a proposed merge after root-cause explanation -> inspect and back \r\nup first, then merge the minimum needed settings section instead of overwriting unrelated hooks. [Task 1]\r\n\r\n## Reusable knowledge\r\n\r\n- PowerShell execution policy blocks npm `.ps1` shims on this machine: use `claude.cmd` and `npm.cmd`. Chinese-containi\r\nng PowerShell scripts must be UTF-8 with BOM; BOM-prefixed text is unreliable for context `apply_patch`, so reread and \r\nrewrite/delete+add if needed. [Task 1]\r\n- The durable provider source is `C:\\Users\\79873\\.claude\\settings.json` `env`; validate it with `Get-Content -Raw | Con\r\nvertFrom-Json` and back it up before edits. If a process wipes `env` but leaves `hooks`, merge `env` from `settings.jso\r\nn.bak.<timestamp>` instead of replacing the file. [Task 1]\r\n- CLI quick check: `claude.cmd -p \"Reply exactly OK\"`. Current CLI and GUI are independent: the JetBrains `idea-claude-\r\ncode-gui` uses its bundled Agent SDK rather than shelling out to `claude.cmd`; CLI upgrades do not upgrade that SDK. [T\r\nask 1]\r\n- For GUI verification, `.codemoss\\config.json` needs `claude.current = \"__local_settings_json__\"`; drive the plugin br\r\nidge `channel-manager.js claude send` with `CLAUDE_USE_STDIN=true` and JSON stdin, then kill stale `claude` daemons aft\r\ner config changes before rechecking. [Task 1]\r\n- Claude Code skills belong at `~/.claude/skills/<name>/SKILL.md`; verify via a `/skill-name` CLI prompt. Third-party C\r\nhatCut installed only a Claude skill, not a Codex integration; after uninstall it may leave its skill folder behind. [T\r\nask 1]\r\n\r\n## Failures and how to do differently\r\n\r\n- Symptom: a `.ps1` shim says scripts are disabled, or a Chinese script parses incorrectly. Cause: machine execution po\r\nlicy / UTF-8-without-BOM. Fix: invoke `.cmd`; save Chinese `.ps1` as UTF-8 with BOM. [Task 1]\r\n- Symptom: `SetEnvironmentVariable(...,'User')` hangs. Cause: this machine stalls during environment broadcast. Fix: do\r\n not persist provider config in Windows env; prefer `settings.json` (registry writes are only a fallback for unrelated \r\nvariables). [Task 1]\r\n- Symptom: bridge receives empty/null message. Cause: `CLAUDE_USE_STDIN=true` was omitted. Fix: set it before piping JS\r\nON; do not infer GUI behavior from CLI success. [Task 1]\r\n- Symptom: a custom model generates an unknown-context-window warning. Fix: record it as a model-mapping limitation; us\r\ne the documented model override/window setting only after preserving valid provider configuration. [Task 1]\r\n\r\n# Task Group: youpu sprint / Pay allocation with Alipay/WeChat Mock channels\r\nscope: Implement, test, commit, or report the Pay module's Alipay Direct/ISV and WeChat allocation (profit-sharing) flo\r\nw; distinguish validated Mock coverage from unrun real-channel integration.\r\napplies_to: cwd=D:\\workspace\\YeQianWorkSpace\\youpu\\sprint\\yopu-cloud-platform; reuse_rule=branch commits, retained work\r\ntree changes, external-channel readiness, and config values must be rechecked in the current sprint checkout; the JUnit\r\n4/Mock testing and precise-staging procedure is reusable.\r\n\r\n## Task 1: Implement and validate allocation foundation, Mock channels, and state convergence\r\n\r\n### rollout_summary_files\r\n\r\n- rollout_summaries/2026-09-01T13-33-42-I4bX-yopu_pay_alloc_alipay_wechat_profit_share_mock_dev_and_commi.md (cwd=\\\\?\\D\r\n:\\workspace\\YeQianWorkSpace\\youpu\\sprint\\yopu-cloud-platform, rollout_path=\\\\?\\C:\\Users\\79873\\.codex\\sessions\\2026\\09\\0\r\n1\\rollout-2026-09-01T22-29-26-01a05d2c-f390-7d31-9200-92ca56f037b5_01a05d5f-fa1e-7ba1-ab17-6c5c8bd04724.jsonl, updated_\r\nat=2026-09-02T11:36:05+00:00, thread_id=01a05d2c-f390-7d31-9200-92ca56f037b5, success: 100 Mock tests and module packag\r\ne passed; real-channel integration was not run)\r\n\r\n### keywords\r\n\r\n- yopu-trade-pay, AllocResultServiceImpl, AllocChannelExecutor, AllocStatusPollingTask, AllocMainChainMockTest, trade.p\r\nay.mock.enabled, LambdaUpdateWrapper, TableInfoHelper.initTableInfo, run-alloc-tests.ps1, 100 tests\r\n\r\n## Task 2: Solidify the feature baseline with documentation and precise commits\r\n\r\n### rollout_summary_files\r\n\r\n- rollout_summaries/2026-09-01T13-33-42-I4bX-yopu_pay_alloc_alipay_wechat_profit_share_mock_dev_and_commi.md (cwd=\\\\?\\D\r\n:\\workspace\\YeQianWorkSpace\\youpu\\sprint\\yopu-cloud-platform, rollout_path=\\\\?\\C:\\Users\\79873\\.codex\\sessions\\2026\\09\\0\r\n1\\rollout-2026-09-01T22-29-26-01a05d2c-f390-7d31-9200-92ca56f037b5_01a05d5f-fa1e-7ba1-ab17-6c5c8bd04724.jsonl, updated_\r\nat=2026-09-02T11:36:05+00:00, thread_id=01a05d2c-f390-7d31-9200-92ca56f037b5, success: feature and docs committed separ\r\nately; unrelated retained changes left untouched)\r\n\r\n### keywords\r\n\r\n- 5ab2d3f21, 1252572ff, git add yopu-trade/yopu-trade-pay, trade.pay.allocation.execute-enabled, BizOrderNoGenerator, P\r\nayRequest, application-dev.yaml, Windows invalid path\r\n\r\n## Task 3: Report allocation APIs, jobs, callbacks, and refund-return gate\r\n\r\n### rollout_summary_files\r\n\r\n- rollout_summaries/2026-09-01T13-33-42-I4bX-yopu_pay_alloc_alipay_wechat_profit_share_mock_dev_and_commi.md (cwd=\\\\?\\D\r\n:\\workspace\\YeQianWorkSpace\\youpu\\sprint\\yopu-cloud-platform, rollout_path=\\\\?\\C:\\Users\\79873\\.codex\\sessions\\2026\\09\\0\r\n1\\rollout-2026-09-01T22-29-26-01a05d2c-f390-7d31-9200-92ca56f037b5_01a05d5f-fa1e-7ba1-ab17-6c5c8bd04724.jsonl, updated_\r\nat=2026-09-02T11:36:05+00:00, thread_id=01a05d2c-f390-7d31-9200-92ca56f037b5, success: source-checked progress, API lis\r\nt, and flow report)\r\n\r\n### keywords\r\n\r\n- /v1/trade/unipay/internal/alloc, CallbackController, PayWebMvcConfig, decideReturnGate, SC + payOrderNo, settleConfir\r\nm, allocReturn\r\n\r\n## User preferences\r\n\r\n- when the user said “暂定合单已完成” / “暂缓” and required allocation development -> cover single-payment-order alloca\r\ntion first; do not make unaccepted combined-payment work a prerequisite for real allocation integration. [Task 1]\r\n- when the user selected “A → B” after being told the baseline would be precisely staged without gateway YAML or IM scr\r\nipts -> first compile and classify a large dirty worktree, then commit only the feature and its docs; never mix in user\r\n-retained changes. [Task 2]\r\n\r\n## Reusable knowledge\r\n\r\n- Reuse `RefundServiceImpl` patterns (idempotent business number, `VERSION_NO` CAS, `withPayShard` ThreadLocal, unified\r\n terminal finalization, Outbox) for allocation convergence. `AllocStatusPollingTask` backs off 1/5/15/30 seconds; termi\r\nnal allocation is SUCCESS/PARTIAL_SUCCESS/DEFINITIVE_FAIL, terminal return is SUCCESS/DEFINITIVE_FAIL, and UNCERTAIN is\r\n query-converged rather than blindly retried. [Task 1]\r\n- For no-Spring JUnit4 tests, initialize each entity's MyBatis-Plus `TableInfoHelper` before using `LambdaUpdateWrapper\r\n.set(...)`. Dynamic-proxy in-memory Mappers can use `getSqlSet()`, `getParamNameValuePairs()`, and `getExpression().get\r\nSqlSegment()` to exercise real CAS/idempotency without adding Mockito or changing the POM. Run `powershell -ExecutionPo\r\nlicy Bypass -File yopu-trade/yopu-trade-pay/scripts/run-alloc-tests.ps1`, then `mvn clean package -pl yopu-trade/yopu-t\r\nrade-pay -am -DskipTests`. [Task 1]\r\n- Real-channel swi