- Cover is outside the body count; the cited episodes use 20 body images with frame 20 silent. If an episode uses a rea\r\nl place name, retain the AI-generation/fiction disclosure and an appropriate safety reminder; do not let release copy b\r\ne mistaken for a real incident. [Task 1]\r\n\r\n## Failures and how to do differently\r\n\r\n- Symptom: prose looks finished but one publication surface is stale. Cause: only `publish-copy.md` or only `release-ma\r\nnifest.json` was edited. Fix: keep `description`, `topics`, and `pinned_comment` consistent in both and validate with `\r\nGet-Content -Raw -Encoding UTF8 <manifest> | ConvertFrom-Json`. [Task 1]\r\n\r\n# Task Group: aigc-dali-cat / Story OS full-auto prompting and conditional unattended continuation\r\nscope: Author or resume fully automatic Story OS production with its recognized authorization, deterministic completion\r\n gate, and one-time conditional continuation; do not confuse a running/idle thread with accepted release completion.\r\napplies_to: cwd=D:\\workspace\\YeQianWorkSpace\\yeqian\\aigc-dali-cat; reuse_rule=use on the current Story OS/Codex runtime\r\n after rechecking repo contract, target episode state, and automation availability; episode statuses and thread IDs are\r\n time-specific.\r\n\r\n## Task 1: Recommend a copy-paste full-auto Story OS execution prompt\r\n\r\n### rollout_summary_files\r\n\r\n- rollout_summaries/2026-08-30T06-08-53-fBgG-aigc_dali_cat_story_os_full_auto_execution_prompt_template.md (cwd=\\\\?\\D:\\\r\nworkspace\\YeQianWorkSpace\\yeqian\\aigc-dali-cat, rollout_path=\\\\?\\C:\\Users\\79873\\.codex\\sessions\\2026\\08\\30\\rollout-2026\r\n-08-30T14-18-06-01a05148-ff38-7da3-8292-0fbdf0a9c536_01a05151-6fec-7472-b5d5-76738342e3b3.jsonl, updated_at=2026-08-30T\r\n06:18:40+00:00, thread_id=01a05148-ff38-7da3-8292-0fbdf0a9c536, success: verified a reusable full-auto prompt template \r\nand CODEX runtime entrypoint)\r\n\r\n### keywords\r\n\r\n- story_os.py run --full-auto, 全自动执行, 一次