s. [Task 3]\r\n\r\n## Reusable knowledge\r\n\r\n- The historical release route was `墨脱 → 罗布泊·楼兰之门 → 泥人续·送件 → 新坑视觉试验篇`; it is planning guidance, no\r\nt current publication state. Preserve the structural rationale (罗布泊's seventh image returns the 墨脱 stone-piece pat\r\ntern; 泥人续 changes flavor and inherits the proven motif) but reschedule only after checking live Creator Center. K2/K\r\n4 are held, not filler. [Task 1]\r\n- Use live Creator Center plus `reports/数据验收报告.md`, not README status or an old schedule, for release decisions. \r\nThe prior 2026-08-17 19:03 assumption was superseded: live evidence on 2026-08-18 showed 墨脱 still “定时发布中” for 20\r\n26-08-31 18:25. [Task 1]\r\n- Visual-first means first choose one concrete abnormal carrier that a viewer can understand without subtitles by image\r\n 01 or 03; change its physical state across at least three carriers, scale from small to large, and end with real-world\r\n evidence. The four-image admission test is 图01/03/10/20. Avoid repeating the old 科考队/导师/父亲/哥哥 rescue frame, \r\ncaves/relics/stone gates/glowing veins, 泥人/salt-copy motifs, or “someone disappeared years ago” setup in the first ne\r\nw-pit attempt. [Task 2]\r\n- `reports/下一阶段新坑方向_视觉先行_V1.0.md` is “方案可评审，尚未定题”: it permits visual tests, not direct storyboard\r\n or publication. It proposes old photo studio, last bus with an extra stop, and night maintenance/floor disappearance a\r\ns A/B/D exploration directions. [Task 2]\r\n- Treat the captured forecasts as ranges, not promises and never write them as results: 墨脱's 48h 300-800 remains a fu\r\nture line pending actual publication; 罗布泊 400-1000; 泥人续 48h 500-1200; first new-pit post 300-600, with >1000 / av\r\nerage browse >=9 / swipe-away <=35% as a strong breakthrough. The reusable success structure is `20 张 + 前三张直接异常\r\n + 强关系人物 + 可辨认实体 + 现实残留`. [Task 3]\r\n\r\n## Failures and how to do differently\r\n\r\n- README and episode documents can lag actual platform state -> resolve release readiness from Creat