leton and do not copy completed assets. [Task 2]\r\n- when asked to push only 06A code from a dirty branch -> keep unrelated commits and changes untouched; never use `git \r\nadd -A` or push the main branch blindly. [Task 3]\r\n\r\n## Reusable knowledge\r\n\r\n- 06 has formed S1 墨脱, S2 罗布泊, and S6 东海龙宫; S3 雅鲁藏布江/S4 秦岭/S5 南极 are only idea-pool entries. The recu\r\nrring “青白微光、沿经络纹路流动、明暗如呼吸” supports world continuity, but only S1→S2 has an explicit causal handoff (\r\n墨脱 stone piece to 罗布泊 door pattern); S2→S6 is thematic, not causal. Keep each episode autonomous and advance one w\r\norld fragment. [Task 1]\r\n- The trio division is “林澈找方向，沈青岚定方案，川儿保生还”. 林澈 is smart/strong but rash and father-line-driven; 沈\r\n青岚 has a safety veto and may hide information; 川儿 handles strength, breach/repair, and cannot ignore a plea for hel\r\np. Father evidence is `《实测图补记》`, old recorder, old toolbox, and a debt ledger, with ordinary accident / cover-up\r\n / deliberate entry into relic site remaining parallel explanations. Advance it with one item or trace every 2-3 episod\r\nes, not a full emotional scene each episode. [Task 2]\r\n- The stone piece comes from the S1 event, not the father's legacy. It pulses after leaving, brightens near same-source\r\n sites without navigating, first matches a corner mark in `《实测图补记》` at S1's end, and must recur at least once in\r\n S2. It is not a universal key: use it at most every 2-3 episodes and allow theft, sealing, or dimming. [Task 2]\r\n- In the first scene or release introduction, establish only: former expedition member left after an unexplainable even\r\nt; deceased father left a torn map/unresolved investigation; a pre-rainy-season 墨脱 photo pattern matches that map. Re\r\nplace S1's active-team “导师次仁” framing with local researcher/father contact/material provider. [Task 2]\r\n- The committed directory is `episodes/06A——铁三角/{README.md,docs/01_铁三角_系列背景与人物设定_V1.0.md,assets/characte\r\nrs/,images/,scripts/}`. To isolate a target commit from a mixed `story` branch, check `origin/story..story`, make the t\r\narget-only commit, `git worktree add -b <branch> <path> origin/story`, cherry-pick, fix `git diff --check`, amend, push\r\n, and remove the worktree. The historical branch was `codex/06a-tiejiao`, commit `b144449`. [Task 2][Task 3]\r\n- For the uncertain release-copy review, lead with the strongest father/墨脱 hook, do not disclose the ending stone/map\r\n evidence in the introduction, keep tags location/story-specific rather than `#户外露营`/`#雨雾`, use 图01 rather than \r\n图20 as the cover, and retain the AI-generated declaration. [Task 3]\r\n\r\n## Failures and how to do differently\r\n\r\n- Complex multiline PowerShell embedded directly in a tool-call string can trigger `SyntaxError: Unexpected token '.'` \r\n-> put the complete script in a JS `const cmd` template string before passing it to execution. [Task 1]\r\n- Markdown blank quote lines `> ` caused `git diff --check` trailing whitespace -> remove them before amend/push. [Task\r\n 2][Task 3]\r\n- Directly pushing `story` would carry unrelated commits -> build the isolated worktree from `origin/story` and cherry-\r\npick only the intended commit. [Task 3]\r\n\r\n# Task Group: aigc-dali-cat / Douyin account operations, K5 release gate, and data reporting\r\nscope: Collect Creator Center evidence, maintain the account report, apply the K5 readability gate, choose a measured c\r\nontent experiment, and manage existing works without treating low views as a deletion rule.\r\napplies_to: cwd=D:\\workspace\\YeQianWorkSpace\\yeqian\\aigc-dali-cat; reuse_rule=follow the current production standard, r\r\neport path, episode evidence, and actual upload state; individual metrics and publish recommendations are time-specific\r\n.\r\n\r\n## Task 1: Collect Creator Center data and correct the data-acceptance report\r\n\r\n### rollout_summary_files\r\n\r\n- rollout_summaries/2026-08-13T06-17-48-A2lm-douyin_creator_data_collection_report_update_k5_publish_orde.md (