lan, routing repair, quota design, and acceptance\r\nscope: Translate the IM message-collection PRD into a verified server design, repair gateway routing, test the API cont\r\nract, and state remaining external acceptance gates.\r\napplies_to: cwd=D:\\workspace\\YeQianWorkSpace\\youpu\\sprint\\yopu-cloud-platform; reuse_rule=branch and file paths are che\r\nckout-specific; the semantic-gap and acceptance rules are reusable for IM features.\r\n\r\n## Task 1: Plan the IM collection feature, repair gateway 404, and verify quota/API design\r\n\r\n### rollout_summary_files\r\n\r\n- rollout_summaries/2026-08-14T09-41-02-UZh2-yopu_im_message_collection_quota_design.md (cwd=\\\\?\\D:\\workspace\\YeQianWor\r\nkSpace\\youpu\\sprint\\yopu-cloud-platform, rollout_path=\\\\?\\C:\\Users\\79873\\.codex\\sessions\\2026\\08\\14\\rollout-2026-08-14T\r\n17-41-02-019fffa5-794d-73b1-9edf-87ebad6f2a94.jsonl, updated_at=2026-08-18T08:10:13+00:00, thread_id=019fffa5-794d-73b1\r\n-9edf-87ebad6f2a94, success: gateway routing repaired; quota/API design verified; external media end-to-end acceptance \r\nremains pending)\r\n\r\n### keywords\r\n\r\n- 消息收藏, GroupMsgCollect, MessageCollection, TB_MESSAGE_COLLECTION_QUOTA, SHARD_UID, ImMessageTypeEnum, 2012006, 201\r\n2007, 2012008, 2012012, im.collection, StripPrefix, /v1/im, 资源不存在, Postman, 10.168.1.233, sprint3-two-rrp-128\r\n\r\n## Task 2: Open unified collection, deprecate the legacy group API, and repair P0 hot paths\r\n\r\n### rollout_summary_files\r\n\r\n- rollout_summaries/2026-08-17T02-59-30-jPGH-im_collection_open_new_deprecate_old_and_p0_acceptance_fixes.md (cwd=\\\\?\\D\r\n:\\workspace\\YeQianWorkSpace\\youpu\\sprint\\yopu-cloud-platform, rollout_path=\\\\?\\C:\\Users\\79873\\.codex\\sessions\\2026\\08\\1\r\n7\\rollout-2026-08-17T10-59-30-01a00da8-efba-7a61-b6df-ab0b2fd773eb.jsonl, updated_at=2026-08-17T09:20:13+00:00, thread_\r\nid=01a00da8-efba-7a61-b6df-ab0b2fd773eb, partial: fixes committed; dev deploy/runtime recheck remains)\r\n\r\n### keywords\r\n\r\n- MessageCollectionController, GroupMsgCollectController, @Deprecated, im.collection.enabled, CollectionSnapshotBuilder\r\n, looksLikeUrl, relative objectKey, MEDIA_COPY_NOT_CONFIGURED, UserSessionIndexMapper, batchUpsertSessionIndex, UPDATE_\r\nTIME, TB_USER_SESSION_INDEX, StripPrefix=1\r\n\r\n## User preferences\r\n\r\n- when the user supplies a PRD and asks “分析这个需求，给我可落地的实施测试验收方案md” -> deliver a concrete repo Markd\r\nown covering implementation, tests, and acceptance after verifying present code; do not treat a superficially similar o\r\nld feature as compliant. [Task 1]\r\n- follow the observed `plan -> 评审 -> 实施` workflow and label “方案可评审” versus “功能已实现” separately. When produ\r\nct decisions conflict, present a decision gate with a recommended default and release condition instead of silently dec\r\niding. [Task 1]\r\n- for implementation completion, do not call compile/static work acceptance: disclose missing DBA DDL, file-service con\r\ntracts, dev integration, and load evidence explicitly. [Task 1]\r\n- when the user shows a PRD screenshot and asks “这些都做了吗，目前是如何设计的” -> give an explicit implemented/not-im\r\nplemented judgement per item; separate IM/server work from file-service or external-contract dependencies and name gaps\r\n rather than saying broadly that it is supported. [Task 1]\r\n- when the user says “打开新接口，将原接口置为 弃用” -> keep the legacy API available and visibly `@Deprecated`; migrat\r\ne new clients to the unified route instead of deleting compatibility endpoints. [Task 2]\r\n- for “列/表是否存在” conclusions, the user asked to check other branches, especially `dev-im-merge` and `dev-imtest` -\r\n> verify schema/mapper evidence across the named branches before claiming an environment is missing a column. [Task 2]\r\n- during staged media acceptance, the user accepted “按设计失败即通过” while the copy contract is absent -> count the d\r\nesigned `2012011`/`MEDIA_COPY_NOT_CONFIGURED` failure as current-phase pass, but leave the success path